{"version":1,"content":"<p>有「翻版姚子羚」之稱的前TVB主播鄧詩穎，近日宣布為老公誕下小千金Harper，榮升人母！</p><p>她於社交網分享在產房的一家三口全家福合照，見當時鄧詩穎剛經歷分娩，明顯見到面上倦容，但當抱住初生女兒，嘴角自然流露出幸福滿足的笑容，而老公更難掩激動，</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.601646+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T13:01:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.769706+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.769706+00:00","content_hash":"c91e1b6015823845d0893c38fec8e1a08e66818a2b30526dc36d54135bd2803b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}